					<element type="List" name="Ideal" requiredLevel="1" checksum="3f04b355" isList="true" registered="4">Might. In life as in war, the stronger force wins. (Evil)</element>
					<element type="List" name="Bond" requiredLevel="1" checksum="72501116" isList="true" registered="4">I’ll never forget the crushing defeat my company suffered or the enemies who dealt it.</element>
					<element type="List" name="Flaw" requiredLevel="1" checksum="cd201956" isList="true" registered="3">I made a terrible mistake in battle cost many lives— and I would do anything to keep that mistake secret.</element>
					<element type="Proficiency" name="Athletics" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_ATHLETICS" />
					<element type="Proficiency" name="Intimidation" id="ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_INTIMIDATION" />
